  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Samoa - Australia Resilience and Climate Pilot</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This investment aims to introduce an integrated set of activities with direct climate resilience and
environmental sustainability objectives into Australia&apos;s bilateral development assistance in Samoa. 
This will be done on a small-scale pilot basis commencing in 2024-25 FY, with the intention for the
pilot projects to help assess viability for an expanded climate bilateral program commencing in
2027.</narrative>
  </description>
